      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "RESIDENTIAL LEASE AGREEMENT\nThis Lease Agreement is made on 1 April 2025 between Mr. Rohan Mehta (the \"Landlord\") and Ms.\nPriya Nair (the \"Tenant\").\nARTICLE 1: RENT AND DEPOSIT\n1.1 The Tenant shall pay monthly rent of Rs. 25,000 to the Landlord by the 5th day of each month.\n1.2 The Tenant shall pay a security deposit of Rs. 50,000 to the Landlord at the time of signing this\nAgreement.\n1.3 The Landlord shall refund the security deposit within 30 days after the Tenant vacates the\npremises.\nARTICLE 2: USE OF PREMISES\n2.1 The Tenant shall not sublet the premises or any part of it to any third party.\n2.2 The Tenant shall keep the premises clean and in good condition.\n2.3 The Landlord is responsible for structural repairs and major maintenance of the building.",
      "extraction_method": "PyMuPDF",
      "character_count": 764,
      "is_likely_blank": false
    },
    {
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "ARTICLE 3: TERMINATION\n3.1 Either party must provide 30 days written notice before terminating this Agreement.\n3.2 This Agreement shall be governed by the laws of India.\nARTICLE 4: GENERAL\n4.1 The Tenant shall pay the monthly rent by the 10th day of each month without any deduction.\n4.2 The Tenant shall provide 60 days written notice before terminating this Agreement.\n4.3 The Tenant may sublet the premises to a family member with the prior written consent of the\nLandlord.\n4.4 The security deposit shall be Rs. 75,000 and is refundable on vacating the premises.",
      "extraction_method": "PyMuPDF",
      "character_count": 565,
      "is_likely_blank": false
    }
  ],
